<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>404 - Page Not Found</title>

  <style>
      * {
          box-sizing: border-box;
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
      }

      body {
          min-height: 100vh;
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
          padding: 30px;
          font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
          text-align: center;
          color: #263238;
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f5e9, #ffffff);
      }

      .error-page {
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 650px;
      }

      .error-code {
          font-size: clamp(5rem, 18vw, 10rem);
          line-height: 0.9;
          color: #2e7d32;
          opacity: 0.15;
      }

      .dodo-image {
          display: block;
          width: min(100%, 330px);
          max-height: 330px;
          margin: -30px auto 15px;
          object-fit: contain;
      }

      h1 {
          margin-bottom: 12px;
          font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 5rem);
          color: red;
      }

      h2 {
          margin-bottom: 12px;
          font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3rem);
          color: #1b5e20;
      }

      p {
          margin-bottom: 28px;
          color: #607d68;
          font-size: 1.1rem;
          line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .home-button {
          display: inline-block;
          padding: 13px 28px;
          border-radius: 30px;
          color: white;
          background-color: #2e7d32;
          font-weight: bold;
          text-decoration: none;
          transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
      }

      .home-button:hover {
          transform: translateY(-3px);
          background-color: #1b5e20;
      }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<main class="error-page">

  <img
    class="dodo-image"
    src="../../assets/dodo_image.png"
    alt="A confused dodo"
  >
  <h1>404</h1>
  <h2>OUH LA,  ON N'A PAS ENCORE FINI CETTE PAGE </h2>

  <a class="home-button" href="/">Retourner</a>
</main>
</body>
</html>